          {
            "fragment": "The cubic expands as X^3+VX^2+UzX+z^2, with value R^2=1+V+Uz+z^2 at X=1. Its roots are distinct because a,b,c are distinct and nonzero, so the curve is nonsingular. Order exactly 3 also implies R is nonzero.",
